# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Policy artifacts  [Addendum 1 section 4 — never-commit list]
#
# The scoring policy is proprietary. Only the demonstration pack may be
# committed. These rules are deliberately deny-by-default: a new policy file
# with an unanticipated name is blocked rather than allowed, because the cost
# of over-blocking is an explicit override and the cost of under-blocking is an
# irreversible disclosure.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
policy/*
!policy/README.md
!policy/demo.*.json

# Production naming conventions, blocked explicitly wherever they appear
*.policy.json
*policy.prod*.json
*policy.production*.json
*.private.json
**/policy.prod*
**/policy.production*
**/*_policy_weights*
